---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — The Flip" description="What The Flip is and why it exists.">
  <h1>About The Flip</h1>
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      The Flip exists because a lot of news isn't wrong so much as incomplete — a true headline
      built on a framing that leaves out the context you'd need to actually understand the story.
      Each article here takes one piece of coverage, names the outlet and the original headline,
      and rewrites it with the missing context and data restored, sourced and linked so you can
      check the work yourself. The goal isn't to swap one slant for another — it's to put back
      what got cut.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
